<title>CANADA: WCE, Canada commodity markets closed on Dec 26.</title>
<headline>WCE, Canada commodity markets closed on Dec 26.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Winnipeg Commodity Exchange and most Canadian cash grain and livestock markets were closed on Thursday, Dec 26, for the Boxing Day holiday.</p>
<p>The Canadian Wheat Board, Manitoba Pool, Ontario Agriculture Ministry and other agencies said no cash prices would be issued on Thursday, with updates to resume on Friday, Dec 27.</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
